      "text": "# dsh-prompt-customizer bundle patch: inserts the dual-face plugin row into\n# the web profile roster. Applied as a profile bundle layer (the\n# `dsh.bundle.patch` manifest field). The node half (exports \".\") runs in the\n# host process: prompt filtering (block / replace / inject / ordering, inventory\n# & preview routes), skill bundle management + toggles + health, and MCP status /\n# presets / masking / tool-level enable-disable. The `dsh.client` declaration in\n# package.json loads the browser half (exports \"./client\", served at\n# /plugins/prompt-customizer/client.js): the capability panel (SKILL / MCP /\n# 提示词 tabs) plus the `/` skill source.\n- insert:\n    - id: prompt-customizer\n      name: 'dsh-prompt-customizer'"
    }
